To achieve this, you'll need to modify the `location /` block in your first `server` block to include a rewrite rule that adds the www prefix to the URL. Here's how you can do it:

Replace the `location /` block with the following code:
```
location / {
    root /usr/share/nginx/html;
    index index.html index.htm;
    try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;

